{"code":"312610","name":"에이에프더블류","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 설립된 마찰용접기술 및 다이캐스팅 기반 친환경차량 전장품 금속가공 전문업체로, 2019년 코스닥시장에 상장함. FSW를 활용한 전기차용 BCCM과 다이캐스팅 기반의 End Plate를 생산하고, 음극마찰용접단자, Axle shaft 등 다양한 금속가공품을 보유하고 있음. 2026년 LG이노텍, 세아메카닉스 통해 BCCM 및 End Plate 납품을 시작하며 xEV 전장품 사업을 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":37.0,"open":37.0,"high":37.0,"low":37.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":-70.4,"ret_60":-91.1905,"ret_120":-97.4017,"ret_250":-97.3944,"ma20":55.7,"ma60":232.7333,"ma120":539.8417,"ma200":809.715,"close_vs_ma200":-95.4305,"close_vs_ma60":-84.102,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-99.9996,"r2_60":0.8443,"slope_120":-99.9146,"r2_120":0.8644,"slope_250":-94.0738,"r2_250":0.6959,"high52":1851.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":1.9989,"dd_52w":-98.0011,"mdd_1y":-98.0011,"atr14_pct":60.8108,"vol_ann_60":172.0196,"vol_avg20":1095186.8,"vol_ratio20":0.0,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":3.0278,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":82196015.8,"amount_avg60":139719741.7,"obv_chg20":-49.7229,"turnover_20":108.1298,"pv_eff_20":-0.6511,"rsi14":21.7455,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":-549263.0,"inst_net_20":41429.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-2.7115,"inst_net_20_pct":0.2045,"smart_net_20_pct":-2.507,"frgn_net_60":-18054.0,"inst_net_60":41429.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0891,"inst_net_60_pct":0.2045,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1154,"frgn_net_120":311177.0,"inst_net_120":41421.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":1.5362,"inst_net_120_pct":0.2045,"smart_net_120_pct":1.7406,"foreign_ratio":1.44,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.89,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-26.0,"op_margin_q":-40.0,"op_qoq":-30.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-4.0,"rev_yoy":80.5556,"op_trend_4q":0.8333,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-21.26,"debt_ratio":55.53,"per":null,"pbr":0.02,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.44,"target_